20.922, "timestamp": "00:03:40", "text": "模範的なアスリート。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 223.86599999999999, "timestamp": "00:03:43", "text": "新人アスリート。はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 227.817, "timestamp": "00:03:47", "text": "えーっと、手短に言うと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 228.665, "timestamp": "00:03:48", "text": "言うと、それは"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 229.893, "timestamp": "00:03:49", "author": "@terence1m1", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ZSLu2xKu0AG9hyqD2TMVUX0PWhfge9RgOTT9L5VJe5jcXwM-tiCva-Da6sNfe1NbMkVYd-a0=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "just joking 😃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 230.04399999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:50", "text": "主に、ええと、なぜなら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 231.423, "timestamp": "00:03:51", "text": "ええと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 232.624, "timestamp": "00:03:52", "text": "ずいぶん長い間ご無沙汰しております。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 233.826, "timestamp": "00:03:53", "text": "時間、彼らは私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 234.887, "timestamp": "00:03:54", "text": "声が紛らわしい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 236.124, "timestamp": "00:03:56", "text": "新規視聴者または"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 237.43200000000002, "timestamp": "00:03:57", "text": "見る人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 238.66899999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:58", "text": "私には関係ない、彼らは気にしない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 239.871, "timestamp": "00:03:59", "text": "混乱している"}]